  "source_pdf": "downloads/pigsys-boing-boing-band-v2-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "ac498d5d8ff68db2b16b077b55fc7b1d8ae44c5d7089bc5fc2c77d3d7e62053b",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6b222c34777cc813f676abcb958737f461d6efa0b75b49833584a07bf84bde38",
      "text": "八戒的\n嗡嗡音乐会",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "bf7d458b77331524a92b090c1200b14f992952ecf969a4419f9a4808f205d954",
      "text": "八戒用一个大纸盒做了只青蛙，\n肚子圆滚滚的。\n八戒说：“青蛙一定要会‘嗡’\n一声！”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f3fcdf1f95e9c8a2f06ac265c9d2867f001c60b4bbffe9c1eeb261102a68f14f",
      "text": "沙僧来帮忙，\n把两根宽宽的橡皮筋绷在青\n蛙嘴上。\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cc1e30616db1630fd3d889b8d3adc5aa6520932bfc0de230f3fa10ca7c5e61da",
      "text": "悟空拨了一下橡皮筋。\n“嗡——”青蛙唱起来了。\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "09b8f58d6d3624243c59c87468b3cf6a90ed927dca9896abc828122d8c108902",
      "text": "他按住橡皮筋，想再拨一次——\n声音没了！\n“小青蛙，你怎么不唱了？”\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "db14e9e800dd8f13e16d72d432ed747adc923e65d9d162952910c7a21f787ca7",
      "text": "八戒拍拍青蛙：\n“小青蛙，你是不是困了？”\n青蛙一声也不吭。\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "07dfa4844918c3a3c582dc47e58b7cc42405e7b89789f06d448d0a23a5179065",
      "text": "哪吒想到一个办法：\n“我们边看边听。\n再拨一次，盯着橡皮筋看。”\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3eb44514843407c4ea83706d5ae623fd2e8a2b6fc5bf356d74b7550d0931bd38",
      "text": "“嗡——”橡皮筋抖得飞快，看得\n人眼都花了。\n哪吒说：“它在振动，\n声音就是这么来的。”\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "04e4933c62f7b0f15df761e7a029129c37336538ed8132b1470551c8597c8663",
      "text": "悟空按住橡皮筋，\n橡皮筋不振动了，\n声音也停了。\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6f326696b881f59c4b7f9eab519f66ed2b8c27c7472a65b186458d1621656bac",
      "text": "八戒拨一下，再摸摸纸盒。\n嗡嗡嗡，手心能感觉到它在抖。\n八戒说：“好痒呀！”\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "573fd0a61a961b3cccdae21831d0db75e32107c561c605b4721af471226cec59",
      "text": "这次，两根一起拨。\n“嗡——嗡——”\n悟空按住其中一根，\n就只剩下一个声音了。\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "662a4e69fbf3de9128d4bc0af9cb0b525662b6d8e90f65e2569fedf8096ea1bc",
      "text": "悟空说：“橡皮筋一抖，就‘嗡—\n—’！\n橡皮筋不动，就没声音！”\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "70dc1aeccba699d93516750e85f0b52e6fec273a6b4b6a0aee2a67ba23b04c26",
      "text": "八戒想开一场又大又响的\n音乐会，\n伸手就要使劲拉橡皮筋。\n沙僧说：“轻轻拨，\n小青蛙喜欢小声唱。”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0fc8ccc24d3e3158c35af9426966ffc1232ef569c0d43fc0f99bc2d706426ab0",
      "text": "八戒拨一根，哪吒拨另一根。\n悟空一喊“停！”，\n大家就按住橡皮筋。\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8ff73cf7a838497cdf81518e5eebd171bcfcbaed2ae1f86ae3bf108e8bf29307",
      "text": "“嗡，嗡……停！”\n“嗡……停！”\n一首轻轻的小曲子。\n沙僧轻轻地鼓掌。\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f08b39d301db7d11ec07c559109e089c6f9ecf13afa37d30a2a4905c30670923",
      "text": "八戒向青蛙鞠了一躬，\n肚子“咕噜”叫了一声。\n悟空说：“又一个新声音！”\n八戒说：“该吃点心啦！”\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d5fe2412537ab0ab9a468f8fb7e11a30b221231ff6b956d3c19f2625a27017f1",
